    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">03 May 2017, Kalu, Ethiopia - Members of Ã«Selam Vegetable Growers GroupÃ® working on a vegetable garden owned and managed by the youth group. Local young people are vulnerable to distress migration and the horticulture enterprise assisted them to create self-employment opportunity.</rdf:li>
